\The hand is down again, open beside the coat. #id:line.Day2.result.D.029
\The cheek burns beneath my palm. Lavinia's eyes stay on my mouth. #id:line.Day2.result.D.030
\“Why are you smiling?” #id:line.Day2.result.D.031
