\The door opens. Music from the bar fills the pause. I go back to my chair. #id:line.Day2.threshold.stay.001
\Lavinia remains in the doorway. #id:line.Day2.threshold.stay.002
\“You're still smiling.” #id:line.Day2.threshold.stay.003
\“I want you here.” #id:line.Day2.threshold.stay.004
\“You deserved it.” #id:line.Day2.threshold.stay.005
\“I wanted you here before that.” #id:line.Day2.threshold.stay.006
\She puts one arm into her coat. The other sleeve hangs empty. #id:line.Day2.threshold.stay.007
