\Her fingers smooth the hair away from my forehead. #id:line.Day2.threshold.cruel.005
\“Still asking me to stay?” #id:line.Day2.threshold.cruel.006
\“Yes.” #id:line.Day2.threshold.cruel.007
\Lavinia laughs once. Her fingers keep moving. #id:line.Day2.threshold.cruel.008
\“You deserved that, Priscilla.” #id:line.Day2.threshold.cruel.009
\“I'm still asking.” #id:line.Day2.threshold.cruel.010
\Her fingers stop at my temple. #id:line.Day2.threshold.cruel.011
\A little longer. #id:line.Day2.threshold.cruel.012
\“Look at me.” #id:line.Day2.threshold.cruel.013
\I turn toward her. #id:line.Day2.threshold.cruel.014
\The hand falls away. #id:line.Day2.threshold.cruel.015
\“No.” #id:line.Day2.threshold.cruel.016
\She puts on her coat and opens the door. #id:line.Day2.threshold.cruel.017
\“Lavinia.” #id:line.Day2.threshold.cruel.018
\The door closes. #id:line.Day2.threshold.cruel.019
